            deep_hint="Think about the purpose of the rule: preventing lawyers from exploiting unrepresented moments to gain unfair advantage. Ask who counts as a protected party, whether an organization's employees are all covered, and what exceptions allow contact. Consider how a lawyer should respond when an opposing party contacts the lawyer directly.",
